OL,3,ABarrecore and Boom Cycle owner suddenly
OL,4,Ashuts studios
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fitness company behind high-end
OL,7,Fexercise classes Barrecore, Boom Cycle,
OL,8,Fand Kobox has suddenly shut all its
OL,9,Fstudios.
OL,11,FCommon Bond emailed customers
OL,12,Fannouncing its locations, all of which
OL,13,Fare currently in London, were closed
OL,14,F"until further notice".
OL,16,FThe firm describes itself as a wellness
OL,17,Fcollective and charges #2,400 for 12
OL,18,Fmonths of unlimited classes. It also
OL,19,Fruns Reformcore and Triyoga brands and
OL,20,Fsaid in August last year it had ten
OL,21,Fsites.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
